          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Er nikotinposer lovlige i Danmark?</h3>
          <p>Yes, nicotine pouches are legal in Denmark as of 2025—with strict conditions. They must contain no more than 9mg of nicotine per pouch, feature only tobacco or menthol/mint flavors, and comply with standardized packaging rules. Retailers must verify you're 18+. Snus (tobacco-containing) is not legal; nicotine pouches (tobacco-free) are.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">What changed for nicotine pouches in Denmark in July 2025?</h3>
          <p>In July 2025, Denmark introduced three major restrictions: a 9mg nicotine cap, a flavor ban (only tobacco and menthol/mint permitted), and standardized packaging requirements. These rules eliminated the wide selection of strong and exotic-flavored products that existed before.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Can I still buy strong nicotine pouches in Denmark?</h3>
          <p>No. The 9mg ceiling is binding for domestic sales. Products above 9mg are prohibited. If you order from international retailers, you risk customs seizure. Stick to 9mg-or-below products sold by reputable retailers to guarantee compliance.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Hvad koster nikotinposer i Danmark?</h3>
          <p>Retail prices in Danish kiosks and supermarkets range from 45-65 DKK per can (&euro;6-&euro;8.70). Online ordering often undercuts this. International retailers like SnusFriend offer lower unit pricing, though with shipping time and customs risk factored in.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Is snus legal in Denmark?</h3>
          <p>No. Snus (moist tobacco for oral use) has been banned in Denmark since 1992 and remains illegal. Only nicotine pouches (which contain no tobacco) are legal. The EU banned snus continent-wide in 2019; Sweden has a historical exemption, but Denmark does not.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Can I order nicotine pouches online to Denmark?</h3>
          <p>Yes, but with caveats. Domestic retailers ship reliably. International retailers like SnusFriend can ship to Denmark, but only compliant products (9mg or under, tobacco or menthol/mint flavors) are guaranteed to clear customs. Non-compliant shipments may be seized.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">What flavors are available in Denmark after the ban?</h3>
          <p>Only tobacco and menthol/mint flavors are legal. Fruit, candy, spice, dessert, and other novelty flavors are prohibited. The July 2025 regulation deliberately narrowed flavor choice to reduce youth appeal.</p>
